config U30PRO_UMP965X_ADC
 bool "U30 Pro native UMP9650/UMP9651 PMIC ADC"
 depends on ARCH_SPRD && IIO && MFD_SC27XX_PMIC && NVMEM && HWSPINLOCK
 help
   Real UMP9650/1 conversion, factory calibration and channel ratios from
   the MU5358 source, adapted to Linux 6.12. Declared shared hardware locks
   are required and conversion errors are propagated to consumers.
